  ┌─ Keys · lazyrunner v<version> ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Run                                                      View                                          │
  │   Space       Start / stop the focused app                 /           Search the focused app's output │
  │   u U         Start · focused / all                        z           Zoom the focused column         │
  │   s S         Stop · focused / all                         + -         Widen / narrow the focused col… │
  │   r R         Restart · focused / all                      =           Equal column widths             │
  │   b B         Build · focused / all                        |           Layout: columns → next          │
  │   q           Quit                                         Ctrl+L      Clear output                    │
  │ Tools                                                      t           Theme picker (Default)          │
  │   d           Switch database                            Help                                          │
  │   i           Install packages: npm ci or npm install      ,           Settings (on/off toggles, r ch… │
  │   i c         npm ci                                       ?           Key reference                   │
  │   i n         npm install                                  :           Command palette                 │
  │   w W         Open in the browser · focused / all        Navigate                                      │
  │   o           Open the focused app's log file              h l Tab     focus another column            │
  │   y           Copy (yank)                                  1-5         jump to a column                │
  │   D           Durations                                    j k ↑ ↓     scroll a line                   │
  │   H           Requests: what the .NET apps served          ^u ^d ^b ^f half page / page (PgUp PgDn)    │
  │   T           Tests: run the project's test suites         gg G < >    oldest / follow new output      │
  │   L           lazygit: git without leaving lazyrunner      n N Esc     search: older / newer / clear   │
  │   x           Menu for the focused app                                                                 │
  │ any key closes · : searches every command · lowercase = focused app, uppercase = all                   │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
